      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6b09beba23562d467c836b6b|full_name} This Canny board is for bug reports, for user support related to connectivity issues isolated to your setup visit the VRChat Help Desk at https://help.vrchat.com/.\n\nTo make an effective bug report to investigate, see: https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062658413-I-found-a-bug-I-want-to-report-a-bug - this'll go nowhere without any actionable information other than a description of a disconnection.",
