  "details": "Description\n\nIt keeps showing messages like \"Connection to VRC disconnected,\" as if my internet connection is terrible. But the network provider never notified us about any issues with the network, and the technicians checked and confirmed there were no problems. So it's probably that the VRC servers are underperforming or that the gaming experience is severely affected and hindered for players in certain areas. I hope you can help investigate this bug.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nRather than saying it's a reproduction, it's more like something that's bound to happen soon. The only workaround is to just accept the prompt and ignore it - it'll automatically reconnect to the world in a bit. This is really frustrating.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 网络\n\n- Frequency: 总是\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
